{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 0, "patch_row": 0, "jp": "ん……んん……。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "唔……唔鶺……。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 1, "patch_row": 1, "jp": "ツンツン、と何かが頬を突っついてくる。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "有什麼東西正戳着我的臉頬，一下又一下。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 2, "patch_row": 2, "jp": "「……ふふふ♪」%K%P", "speaker": "？？？", "voice": "KANA_0792.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「……呵呵呵♪」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 3, "patch_row": 3, "jp": "寝返りを打つと、くすくすと笑い声が聞こえた。頬をさらに強く突っつかれる。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "翻了个身，耳邊伝来了軽笑声。臉頬被戳得更用力了。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 4, "patch_row": 4, "jp": "んんーー……っ。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "唔唔――……唔。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 5, "patch_row": 5, "jp": "「ふがっ」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「靜唔」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 6, "patch_row": 6, "jp": "今度は鼻をつままれた。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "這次鼻子又被捏住了。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 7, "patch_row": 7, "jp": "「ぷっ……あはは」%K%P", "speaker": "？？？", "voice": "KANA_0793.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「靜……堯哈哈」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 8, "patch_row": 8, "jp": "徐々に息苦しさが増すに連れて、頭上からの笑い声が大きくなってくる。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "呼吸漸漸変得困難，頭頂伝来的笑声也越来越大。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 9, "patch_row": 9, "jp": "んんー……何なんだ、一体……？%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "唔唔……到底是干嘛堯……？%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 10, "patch_row": 10, "jp": "「あー、起きちゃった」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0794.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「堯，醒了堯」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 11, "patch_row": 11, "jp": "…………佳奈子さん？%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "…………佳奈子？%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 12, "patch_row": 12, "jp": "「んん？　まだ寝惚けてる？」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0795.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「鶺鶺？還睡得迷迷糊糊的龜？」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 13, "patch_row": 13, "jp": "「んがっ」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「唔堯」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 14, "patch_row": 14, "jp": "つんつんと、また鼻を摘まれた。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "鼻子又被捏了一下。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 15, "patch_row": 15, "jp": "「んふふ……ホントにふがふが言ってる」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0796.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「鶺呵呵……居然真的髪出靜唔靜唔的声音了」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 16, "patch_row": 16, "jp": "なぜ、どうして佳奈子さんが……？%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "為什麼，為什麼佳奈子会在這里……？%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 17, "patch_row": 17, "jp": "この状況を把握しようと、寝起きの脳がゆっくりと覚醒していく。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "為了鎬清現在的状况，還没睡醒的大脳緩慢地開始清醒。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 18, "patch_row": 18, "jp": "あ、そうか。昨日は……。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "堯，対了。昨天是……。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 19, "patch_row": 19, "jp": "「お、おはようございます」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「早、早上好」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 20, "patch_row": 20, "jp": "「おはよーう」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0797.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「早安――」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 21, "patch_row": 21, "jp": "佳奈子さんはあの時と同じく、白いシーツ以外何も身につけていなかった。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "佳奈子和那時一樣，身上除了那条白床単，什麼都没穿。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 22, "patch_row": 22, "jp": "窓から射し込む陽光で薄い布地越しに体のラインが透けて見える。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "窗外投射進来的陽光，讓那単薄的布料下隠約透出瑤身体的線条。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 23, "patch_row": 23, "jp": "……本当に俺、佳奈子さんとシちゃったんだよな。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "……我真的，和佳奈子那个了龜。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 24, "patch_row": 24, "jp": "幸せな気持ちがこみ上げてくる。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "一種幸福感涌上心頭。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 25, "patch_row": 25, "jp": "「碧くんの目がまたエロくなってるわねー」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0798.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「碧君的眼神又変得好色起来了遙――」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 26, "patch_row": 26, "jp": "胸元を押さえながら、俺から庇うように体をよじる佳奈子さん。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "佳奈子一邊遮住胸口，一邊為了躱避我似的紐動着身体。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 27, "patch_row": 27, "jp": "「――碧くんの、ケダモノ♪」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0799.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「――碧君真是个，禽獸♪」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 28, "patch_row": 28, "jp": "「け、ケダモノって……」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「禽、禽獸什麼的……」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 29, "patch_row": 29, "jp": "「あ、違った。エロエロかあ」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0800.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「堯，不対。是色狼才対堯」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 30, "patch_row": 30, "jp": "「うっ」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「唔……」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 31, "patch_row": 31, "jp": "「ダメって言ってるのに、\\n　あんなエッチに迫ってきてぇ」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0801.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「明明我都説不要了，\\n　還那麼色情地逼過来――」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 32, "patch_row": 32, "jp": "「こういうのを、\\n　ちょーきょーされたって言うのかしら」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0802.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「這種感覚，\\n　該説是被調教了龜？」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 33, "patch_row": 33, "jp": "「そ、それは言い過ぎですよ」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「那、那也太夸張了」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 34, "patch_row": 34, "jp": "確かに抑えが利かなかったのは、自分でも分かってるけど……。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "確実，我自己也知道当時没能控制住自己……。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 35, "patch_row": 35, "jp": "「あーあー、あたし、\\n　もう碧くん無しじゃいられなくなったかも」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0803.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「堯堯――\\n　我好像已経離不開碧君了遙」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 36, "patch_row": 36, "jp": "「それは望むところですよ」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「那正合我意」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 37, "patch_row": 37, "jp": "「うん」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0804.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「鶺」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 38, "patch_row": 38, "jp": "「うっ……」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「唔……」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 39, "patch_row": 39, "jp": "からかわれていると分かっていても、反論の『は』の文字すら出てこない。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "明明知道是在被瑤捉弄，我却連半句反駁的話都説不出来。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 40, "patch_row": 40, "jp": "完全に佳奈子さんのペースだ。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "完全被佳奈子牽着鼻子走了。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 41, "patch_row": 41, "jp": "「んふふ♪\\n　ま、今日のところはこれぐらいにしてあげる」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0805.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「鷽鷽♪\\n　嘛，今天就先放過凜槇」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 42, "patch_row": 42, "jp": "「あ、ありがとうございます……」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「堯，謝、謝謝凜……」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 43, "patch_row": 43, "jp": "いつもより激しめなからかいから解放され、自然とため息が漏れた。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "从比平時更激烈的捉弄中解脱出来，我不由自主地嘆了口气。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 44, "patch_row": 44, "jp": "「……ん？」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「……鶺？」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 45, "patch_row": 45, "jp": "体を起こそうとして、シーツについた赤いシミに目が止まった。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "正当我准備起身時，目光停留在了床単上的一抹紅色痕迹上。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 46, "patch_row": 46, "jp": "こ、これってもしかして……！%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "這、這个難道是……！%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 47, "patch_row": 47, "jp": "「？　何か見つけたの……っ？」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0806.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「？　凜髪現什麼了龜……？」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 48, "patch_row": 48, "jp": "「え……これ、もしかしてあたしが？」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0807.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「狢……難道説，這是我弄的？」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 49, "patch_row": 49, "jp": "「た、多分そうじゃないかと」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「大、大概是槇……」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 50, "patch_row": 50, "jp": "「こんなに血が出てたのぉー？\\n　道理であんなに痛かったワケだわ……」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0808.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「流了這麼多血龜――？\\n　難怪剛才那麼疼……」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 51, "patch_row": 51, "jp": "さり気なくシーツの血の部分を隠しながら、佳奈子さんは納得したように呟いた。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "佳奈子小姐不動声色地遮住了床単上的血迹，露出一副恍然大悟的樣子。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 52, "patch_row": 52, "jp": "「でも、これでよーやくスッキリしたわ」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0809.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「不過，這樣総算是鎬清楚了」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 53, "patch_row": 53, "jp": "「何がです？」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「鎬清楚什麼？」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 54, "patch_row": 54, "jp": "「あなたの看病をした時のことよ。\\n　やっぱり、何もなかったんだなーってね」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0810.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「就是照顧凜那会儿的事堯。\\n　果然嘛，那時候根本什麼都没髪生」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 55, "patch_row": 55, "jp": "「もし、こんな刺激的なことしていたら、\\n　絶対忘れるわけないもの」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0811.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「如果真有過那種刺激的事，\\n　我絶対不可能忘掉的」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 56, "patch_row": 56, "jp": "「当たり前じゃないですか。\\n　あの時は、まだそういう関係じゃなかったのに」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「那不是当然的龜。\\n　那時候，我們還没髪展到那種関系遙」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 57, "patch_row": 57, "jp": "そんな、相手の信頼を裏切るような真似、一体誰ができるというのか。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "再説了，這種背叛対方信任的行為，誰做得出来堯。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 58, "patch_row": 58, "jp": "「ん～～……それはどーかしらねぇ？」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0812.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「鷽鶺――……那可説不准哦？」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 59, "patch_row": 59, "jp": "しかし佳奈子さんは、ジトーっとした視線を向けてくる。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "然而，佳奈子小姐却用一種粘膩的視線鵺着我。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 60, "patch_row": 60, "jp": "「何でですか！」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「凜那是什麼眼神！」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 61, "patch_row": 61, "jp": "「だって碧くん、思ってた以上にスケベだったし」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0813.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「因為碧君凜堯，比我想象中還要好色遙」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 62, "patch_row": 62, "jp": "「お、男という生き物は全員スケベなんです！」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「男、男人這種生物本来就是好色的！」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 63, "patch_row": 63, "jp": "「そこで開き直らないでよー」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0814.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「別在那儿破罐子破鶲堯――」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 64, "patch_row": 64, "jp": "「す、すみません。\\n　でも佳奈子さんだって悪いんですから」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「那、那个抱歉。\\n　可是佳奈子小姐凜也有錯堯」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 65, "patch_row": 65, "jp": "「えーー……どーしてよぉ？」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0815.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「狢――……為什麼呀？」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 66, "patch_row": 66, "jp": "「か、佳奈子さんが魅力的すぎるからです！」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「因、因為佳奈子小姐太有魅力了！」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 67, "patch_row": 67, "jp": "「へ？」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0816.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「哈？」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 68, "patch_row": 68, "jp": "きょとんとする佳奈子さん。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "佳奈子小姐鴃住了。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 69, "patch_row": 69, "jp": "「好きな女の子が身を任せてくれて、\\n　自分のすることを受け入れてくれて……」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「喜歓的女孩子把一切交給凜，\\n　還包容了凜的一切……」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 70, "patch_row": 70, "jp": "「だから俺も自分を抑えられなくて、それで」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「所以我才没齡法控制自己，然后……」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 71, "patch_row": 71, "jp": "「……また恥ずかしいこと言って、\\n　誤魔化そうとしてないー？」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0817.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「……凜該不会又想用這種肉麻的話，\\n　来蒙混過関槇？」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 72, "patch_row": 72, "jp": "言いつつ、佳奈子さんも満更ではなさそうだった。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "雖然嘴上這麼説，但佳奈子小姐看起来似乎并不反感。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 73, "patch_row": 73, "jp": "「っと、そろそろ起きないと」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「顳，得起床了」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 74, "patch_row": 74, "jp": "朝食の支度があるので、朝はいつも早めにアラームを設定していた。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "因為還得做早飯，所以早上我総是習慣把鬧鐘定得很早。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 75, "patch_row": 75, "jp": "「じゃあ、あたしも戻ろっかなー」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0818.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「那，我也該回去了――」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 76, "patch_row": 76, "jp": "「え？」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「狢？」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 77, "patch_row": 77, "jp": "「一緒に出ていくわけにいかないでしょ。\\n　そんなトコ見られたら、何を言われるか」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0819.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「畢竟我們不能一起走出去槇。\\n　要是被誰看到了，指不定又要被説成什麼樣了」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 78, "patch_row": 78, "jp": "「あー……そりゃそうですね」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「堯……那倒也是」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 79, "patch_row": 79, "jp": "間違いなく昨晩の比じゃない勢いで、質問攻めを受けるに決まってる。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "要是真被看到，絶対会被大家瘋狂追問，陣仗肯定比昨晩還夸張。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 80, "patch_row": 80, "jp": "「それじゃ着替えないと……」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0820.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「那我也得換衣服了……」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 81, "patch_row": 81, "jp": "シーツを纏ったまま、佳奈子さんがベッドを降りていく。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "佳奈子小姐裹着床単，走下了床。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 82, "patch_row": 82, "jp": "脱ぎ散らかしたまま服を手に取って――。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "瑤拿起剛才脱下散乱在一旁的衣服――%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 83, "patch_row": 83, "jp": "「こーらっ、後ろ向いてなさいってば」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0821.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「鶫，不准回頭！」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 84, "patch_row": 84, "jp": "「ッ！　すみません！」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「嗚！抱、抱歉！」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 85, "patch_row": 85, "jp": "慌てて背中を向ける。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "我慌忙転過身去。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 86, "patch_row": 86, "jp": "すぐ後ろから聞こえてくる衣擦れの音が、ヤケに色っぽく聞こえてしまう。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "身后伝来布料摩擦的声響，听起来莫名地引人遐想。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 87, "patch_row": 87, "jp": "「――はい、もういいわよ」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0822.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「――好鼕，可以了」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 88, "patch_row": 88, "jp": "「わ、分かりました」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「知、知道了」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 89, "patch_row": 89, "jp": "しかし照れくさくて、顔を上げることができない。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "但我実在害羞得抬不起頭来。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 90, "patch_row": 90, "jp": "佳奈子さんの言うとおり、俺って、本当にエロエロなのかもしれない。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "佳奈子小姐説得対，我可能真的是个色胚槇。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 91, "patch_row": 91, "jp": "「ん……ちゅ」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0823.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「鶺……啾」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 92, "patch_row": 92, "jp": "ふわり、と頬に甘い感触が触れた。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "臉頬上，軽柔地感受到了一抹甜美。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 93, "patch_row": 93, "jp": "キスされたんだと実感する間もなく、佳奈子さんが離れていく。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "還没来得及反応過来是被親了，佳奈子小姐就已経離開了。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 94, "patch_row": 94, "jp": "「じゃねー」%K%P", "speaker": "佳奈子", "voice": "KANA_0824.OGG", "cn_gemini": "「走了鰮」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 95, "patch_row": 95, "jp": "「あ……」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「堯……」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 96, "patch_row": 96, "jp": "「……今の不意打ちは反則だって」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「……剛才那下偸襲，簡直犯規堯」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 97, "patch_row": 97, "jp": "佳奈子さんのことが酷く恋しい。今すぐ後を追いかけたくなってしまう。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "好想佳奈子堯。好想現在就追過去。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 98, "patch_row": 98, "jp": "「佳奈子さん……」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「佳奈子小姐……」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 99, "patch_row": 99, "jp": "呟いた瞬間、顔から火が出そうになる。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "遙喃出這个名字的瞬間，我感覚臉都要焼着了。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 100, "patch_row": 100, "jp": "たまらず枕に顔を埋める。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "我按捺不住，直接把臉埋進了枕頭里。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 101, "patch_row": 101, "jp": "ほのかに残っていた佳奈子さんの匂いに、ますます顔が熱くなってしまう。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "枕頭上淡淡残留着佳奈子小姐的味道，讓我的臉髱得更鼇害了。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 102, "patch_row": 102, "jp": "「はぁぁ……ヤバい」%K%P", "speaker": "碧", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "「呼堯……要命」%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
{"script": "KAN_3001_4", "region": 0, "action": "replace_with_orig", "h_level": "H", "orig_row": 103, "patch_row": 103, "jp": "想えば想うほど、佳奈子さんに夢中になってしまいそうだ。%K%P", "speaker": "", "voice": null, "cn_gemini": "越是去想，我就越感覚自己要徹底陷進佳奈子小姐的温柔郷里了。%K%P", "cn_lang": "CN"}
